LAMMPS (7 Feb 2024 - Update 1)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread. (src/comm.cpp:98)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style charge

# Define the lattice structure
lattice fcc 4.05
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 4.05 4.05 4.05

# Define the region where atoms will be created
region my_region block 0 10 0 10 0 10

# Create the simulation box
create_box 1 my_region
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (40.5 40.5 40.5)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid

# Populate the simulation box with atoms according to the defined lattice
create_atoms 1 region my_region
Created 4000 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (40.5 40.5 40.5)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds
mass * 26.98

velocity   all create  0.001 1563967 rot yes dist gaussian

# Define interatomic potential
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ./Al-LEA.eam.alloy Al

dump 			1 all cfg 1000 ./dump/dump.tensile_*.cfg mass type xs ys zs vx vy vz q id
dump			2 all atom 1000 ./tmp/tmp.dump
dump_modify     1 element Al

# Additional commands to run the simulation
thermo 100
run 10000
WARNING: No fixes with time integration, atoms won't move (src/verlet.cpp:60)
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 0 steps, check = yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 8.0630635
  ghost atom cutoff = 8.0630635
  binsize = 4.0315317, bins = 11 11 11
  1 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 1 0 0
  (1) pair eam/alloy, perpetual
      attributes: half, newt